#
# Line endings of files a test reads byte for byte, or a tool rewrites line by line: a checkout
# with core.autocrlf on Windows would otherwise turn them into CRLF and the comparison or the
# rewrite would differ (HISS-21, praetorctl audit).
*.json eol=lf
*.sql eol=lf
.golangci.yml eol=lf
